        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.242,
            0.404,
            0.456,
            0.475
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "What will happen if we keep on adding more salt in a given amount of water?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.48,
            0.4,
            0.883,
            0.439
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Take a clean glass tumbler and fill it half with water."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.481,
            0.442,
            0.882,
            0.482
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Add one spoon of salt into it and stir well till it dissolves completely (Fig. 9.5)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.273,
            0.485,
            0.883,
            0.543
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "z Gradually add a spoonful of salt into the glass tumbler and stir. "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Observe",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " how many spoons of salt you can add before it stops dissolving completely."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.273,
